# dsk-seat-amend.pdl - AMEND and CANCEL my own open offer on the trade screen, in the real editor (2026-11-08). Start: p1's turn (PRE or POST) in a STOPPED game (tests/dsk-stop.pdl) where p1 owns Orange3 and p2 has 30+ cash
# (seed 7 after dsk-seat-turns.pdl). The pet cannot answer while the game is stopped, so the offer STAYS OPEN and the popup shows it: "YOUR OFFER #<id> to p2: ..." with `Amend offer...` and `Cancel offer`.
# Amend opens the SAME trade screen with the draft prefilled with MY terms (mode text "AMEND your offer #<id> to p2", button `Send amendment`, the partner is fixed text); Send calls the engine verb `amend <id>`; Cancel calls `cancel <id>`.
# Run: RELAY_DRIVE_NO_ESC=1 relay_drive <editor window pid> run @.apps/deskopoly/tests/dsk-seat-amend.pdl <x window id>
STEP | see | label:Trade...
STEP | press | label:Trade...
STEP | see | label:Send offer
STEP | press | label:Orange3
STEP | see | label:Orange3 (press: back)
STEP | press | label:ask 10 more
STEP | press | label:ask 10 more
STEP | press | label:ask 10 more
STEP | see | label:ask $30
STEP | press | label:Send offer
STEP | expect | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | contains | give=prop:19;get=cash:30;round=1 | 10
STEP | see | label:YOUR OFFER
STEP | see | label:Amend offer...
STEP | see | label:Cancel offer
STEP | see | label:Accept offer | absent
